<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>FutureInSites Gmail Signature Template</title>
<style>
  body { background: #F5F7FB; padding: 40px 20px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; color: #0B0C10; }
  .panel { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E4E7EE; border-radius: 8px; padding: 24px; }
  .panel + .panel { margin-top: 16px; }
  .panel h2 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px; color: #0B0C10; }
  .panel p { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #64748B; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .panel code { background: #F8F9FB; border: 1px solid #E4E7EE; padding: 2px 5px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 12px; color: #2563EB; }
  .sig-frame { background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px dashed #2DD4FF; border-radius: 6px; padding: 24px; margin-top: 12px; }
  .footnote { font-size: 12px; color: #94A3B8; margin-top: 12px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="panel">
  <h2>Team signature template</h2>
  <p>Replace the three highlighted fields below, then install in your own Gmail account:</p>
  <p>1. Replace <code>[Full Name]</code>, <code>[Title]</code>, and the two <code>[firstL]@futureinsites.com</code> spots (firstname + last initial, e.g. gregl@) with your details.</p>
  <p>2. Click inside the dashed box, press <code>Ctrl/Cmd + A</code> then <code>Ctrl/Cmd + C</code> to copy the rendered signature.</p>
  <p>3. In Gmail: <code>Settings &gt; See all settings &gt; General &gt; Signature &gt; Create new</code>, paste, then save at the bottom.</p>
  <p>4. Under <strong>Signature defaults</strong>, set it for both <em>For new emails</em> and <em>On reply / forward</em>.</p>
  <p class="footnote">The logo is embedded as base64, so it always renders with no external hosting. The brand line stays identical so the firm looks consistent on every thread. Every <code>*@futureinsites.com</code> alias already routes to an inbox.</p>
</div>

<div class="panel">
  <h2>Preview</h2>
  <div class="sig-frame">

    <!-- ===== START SIGNATURE ===== -->
    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #0B0C10;">
      <tr>
        <td valign="middle" style="padding: 0 18px 0 0; border-right: 2px solid #2DD4FF;">
          <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="FutureInSites" width="64" height="64" style="display: block; border: 0; outline: none; text-decoration: none;">
        </td>
        <td valign="middle" style="padding: 0 0 0 18px;">
          <div style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #0B0C10; line-height: 1.3;">
            [Full Name]
          </div>
          <div style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; color: #64748B; line-height: 1.3; margin-top: 3px;">
            [Title]
          </div>
          <div style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.3; margin-top: 3px;">
            <span style="color: #475569; font-weight: 700;">FutureInSites</span>
            <span style="color: #64748B;">&nbsp;|&nbsp;</span><span style="color: #64748B; font-style: italic;">AI Strategy &amp; Engineering</span>
          </div>
          <div style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.3; margin-top: 3px;">
            <a href="mailto:[firstL]@futureinsites.com" style="color: #2563EB; text-decoration: none;">[firstL]@futureinsites.com</a>
            <span style="color: #CBD5E1;">&nbsp;|&nbsp;</span>
            <a href="https://futureinsites.com" style="color: #2563EB; text-decoration: none;">futureinsites.com</a>
          </div>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    <!-- ===== END SIGNATURE ===== -->

  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
